    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "\"Emission reduction potential of freeway stop-and-go wave smoothing\" establishes a counterfactual wave-smoothing benchmark using a quadratic program to reconstruct smooth vehicle trajectories. \"Assessing extreme flood impacts on urban rail transit: A passenger-oriented, resilience-informed framework\" develops a passenger-oriented framework to classify journey impacts into six categories during transit disruptions. \"Who You Are Adds Nothing Detectable to Where You Go Next: Sociodemographic Conditioning in LLM Next-Location Prediction\" evaluates the predictive value of sociodemographic attributes in LLM-based next-location prediction using a closed-set benchmark of 5,000 Shenzhen residents.",
